दीप् दी॑प्यते दीप्य॑ते (दीप्यति), pp. दीप्त (q.v.) blaze,
flame, shine, be brilliant (l.&f.). C. दीप॑यति, ˚ते kindle,
inflame, illuminate;
 excite, raise. I. देदीप्यते blaze brightly, be
radiant. —आ C. inflame, kindle. उद् flame up, burn;
 C. = S. C. उप
C. kindle, set fire to (acc.). प्र flame forth. burn. C. kindle,
inflame, rouse. वि blaze, flame;
 C. kindle, illuminate. सम् flame;
C. inflame, excite. — Cf. अतिदीप्त, आदीप्तप्रदीप्त, स॑दीप्त.

दीपक a. kindling, inflaming, illuminating;
 m. & f.
दीपिका = prec.
